WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.007 --> 00:00:05.193
"It snowed last night!" Harry said.

2
00:00:05.194 --> 00:00:07.645
"Can we go sledding?"

3
00:00:07.646 --> 00:00:14.215
Mom nodded. "Let's go to the big hill."

4
00:00:14.216 --> 00:00:17.092
Emmy found her scarf.

5
00:00:17.093 --> 00:00:20.432
Oliver put on snow pants.

6
00:00:20.433 --> 00:00:23.832
Harry tied his snow boots.

7
00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:27.401
Dad put the sleds in the car.

8
00:00:27.402 --> 00:00:30.960
"Let's go," he said.

9
00:00:30.961 --> 00:00:35.455
The family drove to the tall hill.

10
00:00:35.456 --> 00:00:38.882
The parking lot was at the bottom.

11
00:00:38.883 --> 00:00:44.003
"This will be fun," Mom said.

12
00:00:44.004 --> 00:00:49.576
"The hill is really tall!" Oliver said.

13
00:00:49.577 --> 00:00:53.309
Harry groaned.

14
00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:56.347
"We have to walk up that hill!"

15
00:00:56.348 --> 00:01:00.873
"It's really steep!" Emmy said.

16
00:01:00.874 --> 00:01:04.055
Dad checked a map on his phone.

17
00:01:04.056 --> 00:01:07.817
"There's a parking lot at the top," he said.

18
00:01:07.818 --> 00:01:10.536
"Let's park there."

19
00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:13.964
Everyone got back in the car.

20
00:01:13.965 --> 00:01:18.364
They drove up to the other parking lot.

21
00:01:18.365 --> 00:01:21.880
"This is better," Harry said.

22
00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:27.706
Emmy shot down the hill. "Whee!"

23
00:01:27.707 --> 00:01:31.184
She crashed into a snowbank.

24
00:01:31.185 --> 00:01:37.181
Boom! Harry crashed into Emmy.

25
00:01:37.182 --> 00:01:42.311
Oliver hit a bump and flew off his sled.

26
00:01:42.312 --> 00:01:47.550
Finally Mom and Dad zoomed down.

27
00:01:47.551 --> 00:01:55.225
Everyone lay in the snow and laughed.

28
00:01:55.226 --> 00:02:00.209
"I love sledding," Oliver said.

29
00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:04.380
"Let's do it again!" Mom said.

30
00:02:04.381 --> 00:02:06.662
Everyone got up.

31
00:02:06.663 --> 00:02:10.945
Harry looked at the hill and groaned.

32
00:02:10.946 --> 00:02:18.913
"Ugh. We have to walk back up!"

